<title>UK: Eurofima sets 1.0 billion ATS five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Eurofima sets 1.0 billion ATS five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Creditanstalt Bankverein.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROFIMA</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN ATS   COUPON     7.875     MATURITY    04.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.25    PAY DATE    04.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    VIENNA    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 10	  GOV LAW     AUSTRIA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
